+
+## Rainbow
+
+`rainbow.strength` (0–4, default 0) sets the rain contribution. `rainbow.distanceMeters` (120) and
+`rainbow.depthMeters` (600) describe the start and thickness of the sunlit rain in haze metres.
+The primary and secondary are centred on the antisolar direction. Ground sunlight supplies their colour.
+Cloud and near-haze visibility are sampled along the part of the curtain in front of the camera surface.
